+## SRE Runbook: Production Aegis Core Services
+
+Services: Milvus, MLflow, Redis, Prometheus, Grafana
+
+1) Health checks
+ - Verify pods ready: kubectl get pods -n aegis
+ - Check MLflow web UI, DB connectivity, and artifact store access
+ - Check Milvus health via milvusctl or HTTP probe
+ - Confirm Redis replication and persistence status
+
+2) Alerts to monitor
+ - Prometheus: disk full, OOMKilled pods, high GPU utilization
+ - MLflow: DB connection errors, backlog in artifact upload
+ - Milvus: high memory usage, long query latency
+ - Diffusion workers: OOM or CUDA OOM errors
+
+3) Backup/restore drills
+ - Monthly restore test: restore Postgres dump and Milvus snapshot in staging
+ - Validate Grafana dashboard import and data availability
+
+4) Incident steps for signature/key issues
+ - If KMS key compromised: enable kill-switch, rotate keys per runbook, coordinate with legal and insurers
+
+5) Oncall escalation
+ - Page platform-lead -> crypto-ops -> legal for key-related incidents
